message: "If you use this repository, cite the exact Git commit and the repository URL. The associated manuscript is a working paper."
type: software
title: "Macau Tourism Forecasting Protocol and Audited Evidence"
authors:
  - name: "Macau Tourism Forecasting Protocol contributors"
version: "2026.10.21"
date-released: "2026-10-21"
url: "https://github.com/yqdiao/macau-tourism-forecasting-protocol"
repository-code: "https://github.com/yqdiao/macau-tourism-forecasting-protocol"
abstract: >-
  Protocol, baseline implementation, historical model adapters, and audited
  evidence for evaluating tourism forecast accuracy, downstream computing
  resources, demand regimes, forecast combinations, language-model judgment,
  and delivery reliability. See the reproducibility status for the distinction
  between executable components, archived configurations, and released results.
keywords:
  - tourism demand forecasting
  - time series foundation models
  - forecast combination
  - resource accounting
  - reproducibility
